# <nCPU_local>:             Number of maximum parallel CPU for local computation
# <nCPU_cloud>:             Number of maximum parallel CPU for cloud computation
# <paradigm>:               Efficiency/parallelisation paradigm for 'cloud' com-
#   |                       putations (no effect for 'local' computations)
